csrc/ retains the exact pinned upstream header. compat/elementwise/ changes
only the host cudaFuncSetAttribute function-pointer std::bit_cast to
reinterpret_cast for the RTP PPU clang/GCC10 toolchain, following the existing
RTP SGLang TopK adaptation. Device arithmetic and launch geometry are unchanged.
compat/sgl_kernel/tensor.h and include/sgl_kernel/* are unchanged copies of
the already vendored RTP fp4_indexer bundle's host/toolchain support headers.
That bundle's tensor.h host device-name lookup and utils compatibility fixes
are retained. source-manifest.json records every runtime source hash and its
provenance. No production code imports the SGLang Python package.
